Constant Constructed_Office_d
Title: Constructed Office days
Description: This percentage is not measured but constructed as follows:~
A year has 260 'accessible work days', minus ~5 public holidays, -~5% sickness leave, - ~40 holidays+ADV, ~
this gives about (260 -5)*0.95 - 40 = 202 days divided by 260 = 78%, minus an estimated 10% Working From Home pre-covid = 70%.~
This percentage is then kept constant (in 'do nothing') and multiplied with projected FTE to arrive at constructed # of badge swipes"
Definition: ((260-5)*0.95-40)/260 - 10%
NodeLocation: 184,424,1
NodeSize: 64,24
ValueState: 2,844,267,416,303,,MIDM
NumberFormat: 2,%,4,1,0,0,4,0,$,0,"ABBREV",0,,,0,0,15,

